WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.200
Episode 11

01:38.220 --> 01:39.880
That day,

01:39.900 --> 01:41.240
there were many guests.

01:41.540 --> 01:42.670
The maidservant you're looking for

01:42.690 --> 01:44.370
might not be from my mansion.

01:45.540 --> 01:47.000
If so,

01:47.500 --> 01:49.320
it won't be easy to find her.

01:49.450 --> 01:50.260
What if I visit all the families

01:50.260 --> 01:51.850
one by one?

01:54.260 --> 01:57.090
I'm afraid you'll probably be kicked out.

02:11.010 --> 02:12.830
Maybe we should stop.

02:12.850 --> 02:14.140
Actually, there's still another way.

02:14.140 --> 02:15.920
But it's much worse.

02:16.210 --> 02:17.550
Even worse?

02:17.570 --> 02:19.730
Sister, can I go home?

02:19.980 --> 02:21.250
Ruoruo,

02:21.450 --> 02:23.070
do you know Lin Wan'er?

02:23.090 --> 02:25.060
I've met her several times and talked a few words.

02:25.060 --> 02:26.480
Where does she live?

02:26.570 --> 02:27.700
Sick with tuberculosis,

02:27.700 --> 02:30.800
she stays in an imperial residence all the year round.

02:30.820 --> 02:33.800
She is the key to this marriage.

02:33.820 --> 02:35.920
Come on! Let's go to the imperial residence.

02:39.010 --> 02:40.610
Are you going to

02:41.370 --> 02:43.000
kill her?

02:45.180 --> 02:46.530
Come with me.

02:56.980 --> 02:58.400
You don't go inside?

02:59.780 --> 03:01.480
I don't.

03:02.090 --> 03:04.000
They are crazy!

03:11.490 --> 03:13.180
Lady Ruoruo, wait a moment.

03:13.180 --> 03:14.490
I will go and report.

03:14.490 --> 03:15.810
Thank you.

03:47.010 --> 03:49.350
Fan Ruoruo has gone to the imperial residence,

03:49.370 --> 03:51.550
saying she has brought a famous doctor

03:51.570 --> 03:53.970
to see Wan'er.

03:54.700 --> 03:56.490
Auntie, why are you smiling so weirdly?

03:56.490 --> 03:58.330
That doctor

03:58.490 --> 04:00.200
is Fan Xian.

04:00.490 --> 04:03.140
They're not married yet. How can they meet in private?

04:03.140 --> 04:06.070
I heard that Fan Xian is the student of Fei Jie.

04:06.090 --> 04:09.710
Those who are good at using poison are also doctors.

04:09.730 --> 04:11.640
Let them see Wan'er.

04:14.780 --> 04:16.000
Auntie,

04:16.020 --> 04:17.420
aren't you against

04:17.420 --> 04:19.320
the marriage all the time?

04:20.930 --> 04:22.960
Fan Xian just left Prince Jing's mansion,

04:22.980 --> 04:25.200
saying that he wants to find a maidservant.

04:25.540 --> 04:26.720
A drumstick girl.

04:26.740 --> 04:28.290
You heard about it?

04:29.090 --> 04:30.850
A little bird told me.

04:32.610 --> 04:34.480
Wan'er doesn't want to marry him.

04:34.700 --> 04:37.130
Nor does Fan Xian.

04:38.980 --> 04:40.720
The only person insist on them getting married

04:40.930 --> 04:42.370
is His Majesty.

04:42.740 --> 04:45.760
If Wan'er detests

04:45.840 --> 04:48.410
or even hates Fan Xian,

04:49.140 --> 04:53.320
then His Majesty might reconsider it.

04:53.650 --> 04:55.370
I see.

04:55.610 --> 04:57.560
By pretending to be a doctor,

04:57.580 --> 04:59.090
Fan Xian wants to piss Wan'er,

04:59.090 --> 05:00.470
so as to ruin the marriage.

05:00.490 --> 05:02.090
In this sense,

05:02.650 --> 05:04.530
I hope he can succeed.

05:07.540 --> 05:10.160
Do you think he can see Lin Wan'er?

05:10.540 --> 05:13.570
A patient suffers from a long illness
certainly wants to see a famous doctor.

05:14.580 --> 05:16.720
Choosing a maidservant

05:16.740 --> 05:18.920
over a princess,

05:19.260 --> 05:21.470
it's not worth it.

05:21.490 --> 05:22.920
Indeed.

05:23.330 --> 05:24.840
In this city,

05:24.860 --> 05:27.320
only he will make such a choice.

05:44.700 --> 05:46.200
Second Young Master!

05:47.760 --> 05:48.560
=Lin Gong, the second son of Nanqing Prime Minister Lin Ruofu=

05:48.560 --> 05:50.250
Fan Sizhe.

05:56.890 --> 05:58.640
You must be Fan Xian!

06:05.420 --> 06:06.580
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:06.580 --> 06:07.580
Lady Ruoruo and doctor,

06:07.580 --> 06:09.690
please follow me to see the princess.

06:12.090 --> 06:15.300
Lustful, aggressive, mischievous and ignorant as he is,

06:15.300 --> 06:16.490
Wan'er will never marry

06:16.490 --> 06:17.890
your incorrigible brother.

06:17.890 --> 06:19.050
Tell Fan Xian.

06:19.050 --> 06:20.920
If he doesn't give up,

06:22.540 --> 06:24.410
this is what he'll become.

06:26.330 --> 06:28.320
Who's that?

06:28.540 --> 06:31.410
Do you know who Lin Wan'er is?

06:33.300 --> 06:35.290
She's the bastard daughter of the Princess Royal.

06:36.820 --> 06:39.090
Her birth father

06:39.090 --> 06:41.680
is the current Prime Minister Lin Ruofu.

06:41.700 --> 06:42.910
I've also heard that.

06:42.930 --> 06:45.530
The Prime Minister has two sons.

06:45.580 --> 06:47.000
That's Lin Gong,

06:47.020 --> 06:48.540
the Second Young Master of

06:48.540 --> 06:50.160
the Lin mansion.

06:50.610 --> 06:53.810
So he's the second brother of Lin Wan'er.

06:54.050 --> 06:55.910
Judged from his attitude,

06:55.930 --> 06:58.010
he doesn't seem to like Fan Xian.

06:58.370 --> 07:00.070
That's understandable.

07:00.090 --> 07:02.240
If I were him, I wouldn't like Fan Xian, either.

07:02.260 --> 07:03.210
Lin Gong

07:03.210 --> 07:05.310
cares for Lin Wan'er

07:05.330 --> 07:06.750
since childhood.

07:06.770 --> 07:07.650
If I were in his shoes,

07:07.650 --> 07:08.860
I wouldn't want my sister

07:08.860 --> 07:10.410
to marry such a troublemaker.

07:10.490 --> 07:11.820
Just think about all the troubles Fan Xian has caused

07:11.820 --> 07:13.690
since he arrived in the capital city.

07:13.860 --> 07:14.980
To be honest.

07:14.980 --> 07:16.490
If it weren't for the strict rules of the Lin family,

07:16.490 --> 07:17.330
short-tempered as he is,

07:17.330 --> 07:18.420
he might have rushed into

07:18.420 --> 07:20.570
our mansion long ago.

07:25.490 --> 07:27.040
I've made my point.

07:27.740 --> 07:29.370
Just leave!

07:31.050 --> 07:33.720
Second Young Master, I've brought

07:33.740 --> 07:35.260
a great doctor

07:35.260 --> 07:36.420
to see Wan'er today.

07:36.420 --> 07:38.190
Wan'er has got tuberculosis.

07:38.210 --> 07:40.240
So many famous doctors failed to offer a solution.

07:40.260 --> 07:41.980
Young as he is,

07:41.980 --> 07:44.290
how dare you call him great?

07:56.210 --> 07:57.470
What are you doing?

07:57.490 --> 07:58.920
Go away!

08:00.260 --> 08:00.820
Three!

08:00.820 --> 08:01.540
Guards!

08:01.540 --> 08:02.610
Kick this fraudulent quack

08:02.610 --> 08:03.680
out!

08:03.700 --> 08:05.320
Two!

08:05.860 --> 08:07.140
Ridiculous!

08:07.140 --> 08:08.690
One!

08:13.420 --> 08:14.650
I was right!

08:14.650 --> 08:16.720
His disease...

08:18.460 --> 08:19.750
You... you...

08:19.770 --> 08:22.140
What did you do to me?

08:22.140 --> 08:23.170
Just let me save him first!

08:23.170 --> 08:24.560
His disease

08:24.580 --> 08:25.770
can't be delayed.

08:25.770 --> 08:27.410
His disease...

08:28.650 --> 08:30.150
Your disease has been hidden

08:30.170 --> 08:31.540
for a long time.

08:31.540 --> 08:33.560
Luckily, you meet me today.

08:33.580 --> 08:35.700
It can produce an excruciating pain in the chest.

08:35.700 --> 08:37.290
Once broke out, it can't be delayed.

08:37.290 --> 08:39.280
Or you'll die.

08:39.610 --> 08:41.910
Take this pill right away!

08:43.730 --> 08:45.140
Young Master, if you don't take it,

08:45.140 --> 08:46.810
you'll die.

09:06.020 --> 09:07.410
It's so effective!

09:07.410 --> 09:09.100
What's the name of the disease?

09:09.100 --> 09:11.390
It's called Why Giving Up.

09:11.410 --> 09:12.680
What does it mean?

09:12.700 --> 09:13.970
It means the disease is tricky.

09:13.970 --> 09:15.260
Normally, the cause of the disease can't be figured out.

09:15.260 --> 09:17.280
And eventually, the patient has to abandon treatment.

09:18.820 --> 09:21.210
Why are you still here! Get out!

09:21.610 --> 09:22.890
Yes!

09:25.610 --> 09:26.970
I was wrong.

09:26.970 --> 09:28.830
Master, you're really a great doctor!

09:28.850 --> 09:30.850
Will you forgive my ignorance

09:30.850 --> 09:32.640
and see my sister?

09:32.660 --> 09:35.250
As doctors, we should be benevolent. Just lead the way.

09:41.100 --> 09:42.890
I drugged him.

09:49.020 --> 09:50.030
Second Young Master,

09:50.050 --> 09:50.900
Lady Wan'er has lied down

09:50.900 --> 09:52.770
as you commanded.

09:54.050 --> 09:55.470
Master, sorry for this.

09:55.490 --> 09:57.290
She's unmarried after all.

09:57.290 --> 09:59.240
It's improper for her to show her face.

09:59.260 --> 10:01.770
Master, please.

10:24.900 --> 10:26.020
I'm Fan Xian.

10:26.020 --> 10:26.930
I'm here to see

10:26.930 --> 10:27.700
what my future wife

10:27.700 --> 10:30.010
looks like!

10:40.580 --> 10:41.700
I'm most certain that

10:41.700 --> 10:42.900
by making such a fuss today,

10:42.900 --> 10:45.570
you'll have to let me cancel the marriage!

10:47.020 --> 10:48.480
Fan Xian!

10:55.700 --> 10:56.810
Master.

10:58.140 --> 11:00.470
I'm thinking about the disease.

11:00.490 --> 11:03.010
I'll feel her pulse first.

11:08.850 --> 11:10.390
I'm so sorry.

11:10.410 --> 11:13.120
I'm also doing this for your benefit.

11:13.140 --> 11:15.280
Master, sorry to trouble you.

11:15.970 --> 11:18.820
Who... who are you?

11:18.820 --> 11:20.960
Who is your Young Master?

11:22.370 --> 11:25.250
Master, is there anything wrong?

11:26.220 --> 11:30.450
To treat the disease, a guiding drug is needed.

11:30.490 --> 11:32.010
What is it?

11:32.410 --> 11:34.470
A greasy drumstick under the censer table

11:34.490 --> 11:36.960
in the side palace hall of the Qing Temple.

11:39.490 --> 11:42.890
Such a weird guiding drug.

12:32.580 --> 12:35.370
Why are they still inside?

12:41.820 --> 12:44.460
Lin Gong is inside, and so does Fan Xian.

12:44.460 --> 12:45.410
Will they get into a fight

12:45.410 --> 12:46.890
inside?

12:50.700 --> 12:52.140
What's so good

12:52.140 --> 12:53.810
about girls?

12:54.260 --> 12:58.010
They are talkative and troublesome.

12:59.020 --> 13:00.510
To me,

13:00.530 --> 13:02.650
I might as well count the money!

13:04.140 --> 13:06.150
You're still young.

13:06.170 --> 13:08.450
I'm not!

13:08.490 --> 13:09.830
Besides,

13:09.850 --> 13:12.280
it's not relevant.

13:13.490 --> 13:15.130
Why not have a try?

13:15.780 --> 13:18.600
Try talking to a girl?

13:26.340 --> 13:28.570
That one seems nice.

13:29.220 --> 13:30.810
Should I have a try?

13:30.850 --> 13:32.480
She's good.

13:37.290 --> 13:40.320
Lady, wait a moment!

13:40.340 --> 13:42.210
Would you like to

13:42.260 --> 13:43.580
play Pai Gow with me?

13:43.580 --> 13:45.370
Who are you?

13:45.820 --> 13:50.080
I'm the son of Earl Sinan.

13:51.490 --> 13:53.280
Fan Xian?!

13:55.140 --> 13:57.280
If I were Fan Xian,

13:57.340 --> 13:59.920
will you play Pai Gow with me?

14:18.100 --> 14:19.960
Nothing to look at! Let's go!

14:36.490 --> 14:40.600
Girls are horrible!

14:43.460 --> 14:45.650
What are you doing?

14:47.580 --> 14:48.730
I'm seeing the patient.

14:48.730 --> 14:50.200
Don't you need to feel her pulse?

14:50.220 --> 14:51.680
Watching her face will do.

14:51.700 --> 14:52.880
What do you get?

14:52.900 --> 14:54.490
Does she often cough?

14:54.490 --> 14:55.510
Right!

14:55.530 --> 14:56.780
Does she pine away day by day?

14:56.780 --> 14:57.460
Right!

14:57.460 --> 14:58.880
Does she often sweat?

14:58.900 --> 14:59.610
Right!

14:59.610 --> 15:01.240
Does she often feel a hot flush?

15:01.260 --> 15:03.140
Do you figure that out simply by watching her face?

15:03.140 --> 15:03.900
Has she coughed blood?

15:03.900 --> 15:04.700
Yes, she has.

15:04.700 --> 15:06.010
What's wrong with her?

15:11.460 --> 15:13.080
I've confirmed the case.

15:14.170 --> 15:15.600
It's tuberculosis.

15:16.820 --> 15:18.020
We've already know that.

15:18.020 --> 15:19.350
No need for you to tell us!

15:19.370 --> 15:21.680
It can be treated as long as I know her conditions.

15:21.700 --> 15:23.150
Really?

15:23.170 --> 15:24.440
What does she eat?

15:24.460 --> 15:25.680
We've paid attention to that.

15:25.700 --> 15:27.580
No meat and fish. Keep it plain and simple.

15:27.580 --> 15:29.510
You're risking her life.

15:29.530 --> 15:30.460
How is that?

15:30.460 --> 15:32.220
Tuberculosis is a chronic wasting disease.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.830
She really needs to eat meat and fish.

15:33.850 --> 15:34.970
If she seldom eats meat and fish,

15:34.970 --> 15:36.640
she'll grow weak gradually.

15:36.660 --> 15:37.760
Food such as drumsticks

15:37.780 --> 15:39.020
can definitely be served more often.

15:39.020 --> 15:41.160
I'm worried by eating meat,

15:41.290 --> 15:43.020
I'll feel nauseated.

15:43.020 --> 15:44.650
It's fine.

15:48.220 --> 15:52.250
After vomiting several times, you'll just get used to it.

15:53.850 --> 15:55.450
Is that OK?

15:56.900 --> 15:59.120
I'll write a prescription for her later.

15:59.140 --> 15:59.910
In addition,

15:59.930 --> 16:00.970
open that window

16:00.970 --> 16:02.120
more often.

16:02.140 --> 16:04.560
She needs to breathe the fresh air.

16:04.580 --> 16:06.890
Whether it should be closed or not at night,

16:07.700 --> 16:09.960
it's up to the lady.

16:11.530 --> 16:13.010
After all,

16:13.930 --> 16:16.920
you have to prevent others from entering your room at night.

16:31.490 --> 16:34.250
Second Young Master, see you later.

16:35.290 --> 16:36.830
Lady Ruoruo,

16:36.850 --> 16:39.270
the doctor is really talented.

16:39.290 --> 16:40.930
Our family

16:40.930 --> 16:42.350
really owes you this time.

16:42.370 --> 16:43.910
But my mind has not changed.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.020
I won't let your brother

16:45.020 --> 16:46.510
marry Wan'er.

16:46.530 --> 16:48.260
Because Wan'er already has someone

16:48.260 --> 16:49.220
in her heart.

16:49.220 --> 16:50.650
-Who? -What?

16:55.290 --> 16:57.490
It must be Guo Baokun,

16:57.490 --> 16:58.530
son of the Minister of the Board of Rites,

16:58.530 --> 17:00.690
who serves as the imperial compiler.

17:01.340 --> 17:02.050
Guo Bao...

17:02.050 --> 17:03.840
Second Young Master, see you.

17:03.930 --> 17:05.050
Guo Baokun?!

17:05.050 --> 17:07.630
How could it be Guo Baokun?

17:07.650 --> 17:10.410
Guo Baokun?

17:13.740 --> 17:14.910
Second Young Master,

17:14.930 --> 17:16.890
who's that?

17:17.290 --> 17:19.440
A famous doctor invited by Ruoruo.

17:19.580 --> 17:21.440
He's really good.

17:25.530 --> 17:27.170
Why did you just stand there and watch me get kicked?

17:27.170 --> 17:28.910
You're a swordsman after all.

17:28.930 --> 17:29.980
She just

17:29.980 --> 17:31.340
kicked me suddenly!

17:31.340 --> 17:32.170
Why don't you help me?

17:32.170 --> 17:33.250
Your brother is the one who pays me money,

17:33.250 --> 17:34.650
not you.

17:37.860 --> 17:39.410
Then you've done nothing wrong.

17:43.010 --> 17:44.720
Finally, you're out.

17:54.500 --> 17:56.170
How could it be Guo Baokun?!

17:56.170 --> 17:57.840
It's too dramatic!

17:57.930 --> 17:59.720
Why is Guo Baokun involved?

17:59.740 --> 18:01.930
She spat blood?

18:02.930 --> 18:04.130
Just ask her

18:04.130 --> 18:06.080
about it.

18:06.580 --> 18:09.650
Don't you have a date with her tonight?

18:13.530 --> 18:14.930
Sister,

18:15.100 --> 18:16.960
a date with whom?

18:17.740 --> 18:19.390
Lady Drumstick.

18:19.410 --> 18:22.050
It's all set. They'll meet through a window.

18:35.580 --> 18:36.740
Tidy up the room.

18:36.740 --> 18:38.010
Yes.

18:38.460 --> 18:40.370
I've heard that Fan Xian wants to cancel the marriage.

18:40.930 --> 18:42.910
Fan Xian is so rude!

18:42.930 --> 18:43.870
Do be relieved.

18:43.890 --> 18:45.050
I won't let you marry

18:45.050 --> 18:47.080
a vulgar man like him.

18:48.380 --> 18:50.080
Dad is also to blame for this.

18:50.100 --> 18:51.220
Powerful as he is,

18:51.220 --> 18:52.340
he can turn down

18:52.340 --> 18:53.770
the Fan family directly,

18:54.700 --> 18:56.440
but he actually refuses to do it.

18:56.460 --> 19:00.250
After all, I'm not a member of the Lin family.

19:00.860 --> 19:02.380
Dad can't intervene.

19:02.380 --> 19:03.600
How come you are not a member?

19:03.620 --> 19:05.840
You're my younger sister.

19:05.980 --> 19:07.560
You've been treated unfairly for so long.

19:07.580 --> 19:08.910
You deserve to have

19:08.930 --> 19:10.930
a satisfied marriage.

19:11.930 --> 19:13.990
Rest assured.

19:14.010 --> 19:17.010
If dad doesn't handle this, I will.

19:19.100 --> 19:19.770
Haven't you been always saying that

19:19.770 --> 19:21.800
you want to marry for love?

19:21.820 --> 19:23.100
I'll make sure you do!

19:23.100 --> 19:24.440
Whoever you like,

19:24.460 --> 19:26.770
I'll get him for you even by force.

19:27.010 --> 19:29.560
But the marriage is granted by His Majesty.

19:31.860 --> 19:33.910
Our family has pledged loyalty to His Majesty.

19:33.930 --> 19:35.200
But that doesn't mean girls of our family

19:35.220 --> 19:37.130
should marry anyone chosen by His Majesty.

19:37.500 --> 19:39.050
If we're pushed too hard,

19:39.700 --> 19:41.440
we can defy the imperial order at the worst.

19:46.380 --> 19:48.080
Brother, I know

19:48.100 --> 19:50.250
you care about me.

19:50.500 --> 19:52.720
It's so nice to have an elder brother!

19:54.700 --> 19:57.030
Wan'er, let Ling'er keep you company.

19:57.050 --> 19:59.480
Have some girl talks.

19:59.500 --> 20:02.080
No need to worry about anything else.

20:02.100 --> 20:04.480
But don't talk too late.

20:04.530 --> 20:06.270
Go to sleep on time.

20:06.290 --> 20:07.320
Fine.

20:07.340 --> 20:09.460
Ling'er, it's cold outside.

20:09.460 --> 20:11.200
Take Wan'er inside, please.

20:12.010 --> 20:14.340
OK. Rest assured.

20:14.340 --> 20:17.050
I'll send her to bed on time.

20:22.500 --> 20:24.530
Are you staying tonight?

20:24.620 --> 20:25.930
Yes.

20:27.820 --> 20:29.460
You don't have to.

20:29.460 --> 20:31.010
Moreover, open that window more often.

20:31.010 --> 20:33.200
Whether it should be closed or not at night,

20:34.530 --> 20:37.050
it's up to the lady.

20:39.010 --> 20:40.720
After all,

20:41.410 --> 20:44.410
you have to prevent others from entering your room at night.

20:46.340 --> 20:48.250
Must it be tonight?

20:49.220 --> 20:51.290
I haven't stayed here for a long time.

20:51.890 --> 20:55.440
Well, you don't want me to stay over?

21:16.890 --> 21:19.050
Lady Drumstick is Lin Wan'er!

21:19.050 --> 21:20.620
Then the girl beat me just now must be...

21:20.620 --> 21:22.150
Ye Ling'er.

21:22.170 --> 21:23.360
No wonder.

21:23.380 --> 21:25.360
Who's Ye Ling'er?

21:25.380 --> 21:26.410
She's the only daughter of Ye Zhong,

21:26.410 --> 21:28.480
the Chief Guard of the capital city.

21:28.500 --> 21:30.290
I've never heard of him.

21:30.530 --> 21:32.770
Ye Liuyun, who is among the Four Great Masters,

21:32.770 --> 21:33.770
is her granduncle.

21:33.770 --> 21:35.740
She's practiced martial arts since childhood.

21:35.740 --> 21:36.990
And she just loves to fight.

21:37.010 --> 21:38.870
Why did she beat you?

21:38.890 --> 21:40.910
She thought I was you!

21:40.930 --> 21:43.230
Then why does she want to beat me?

21:43.250 --> 21:45.270
Because she's a close friend to Wan'er.

21:45.290 --> 21:46.860
She must have heard the rumors about you.

21:46.860 --> 21:48.960
So she doesn't want Wan'er to marry you.

22:07.980 --> 22:09.560
I've decided.

22:09.580 --> 22:10.620
After tonight,

22:10.620 --> 22:12.530
I'll visit the Fan mansion.

22:12.620 --> 22:14.360
For what?

22:14.380 --> 22:16.360
Fan Xian has learned to practice martial arts.

22:16.380 --> 22:17.960
I'll challenge him

22:17.980 --> 22:20.030
and give him a good beat.

22:20.050 --> 22:22.410
I will make him give up the marriage.

22:27.130 --> 22:28.410
Don't stand here. You might catch a cold.

22:28.410 --> 22:30.410
Let me close the window for you.

23:03.250 --> 23:04.680
Don't touch!

23:31.050 --> 23:33.320
Will the carriage turn over?

23:58.200 --> 24:00.030
What happened?

24:32.010 --> 24:33.480
Is there anyone?

26:47.290 --> 26:50.480
The heaven, earth and man exist in harmony.

26:50.530 --> 26:53.770
Gentlemen shall not stay up for work.

26:53.860 --> 26:58.050
It's midnight already.

27:03.620 --> 27:05.680
Don't cause any trouble recently.

27:05.770 --> 27:07.230
Why do you say so?

27:07.250 --> 27:10.080
Your dad has agreed to break off the engagement.

27:11.700 --> 27:13.620
Recently, he's been thinking about

27:13.620 --> 27:14.720
your words.

27:14.740 --> 27:17.130
Then he realized you're right.

27:17.130 --> 27:19.230
Right for what?

27:19.250 --> 27:20.700
Compared to the financial power of the Neiku,

27:20.700 --> 27:22.410
perhaps your mom

27:22.410 --> 27:23.620
would rather see you

27:23.620 --> 27:25.250
with someone you love.

27:25.460 --> 27:27.580
He said he would plead to His Majesty

27:27.580 --> 27:29.770
to cancel the engagement,

27:30.820 --> 27:33.580
so that you can find that Lady Drumstick.

27:33.580 --> 27:34.620
Whatever

27:34.620 --> 27:35.650
her status is,

27:35.650 --> 27:36.820
he will support you

27:36.820 --> 27:38.680
as long as you like her.

27:40.380 --> 27:42.750
You've been quarreled over this for so long.

27:42.770 --> 27:43.700
It's not easy for him

27:43.700 --> 27:45.010
to admit his mistake right away.

27:45.010 --> 27:46.100
I just said all these

27:46.100 --> 27:47.960
on his behalf.

27:48.860 --> 27:51.440
Well...

27:54.380 --> 27:56.600
I've also thought about it for a long time.

27:57.250 --> 27:59.370
What about

28:00.250 --> 28:02.370
we keep this marriage?

28:03.380 --> 28:04.960
What?

28:06.890 --> 28:08.930
You're the one who wanted to break off the engagement.

28:08.930 --> 28:09.890
Now suddenly,

28:09.890 --> 28:11.930
you want to keep it instead.

28:11.930 --> 28:13.150
Don't be mad!

28:13.170 --> 28:13.980
I know

28:13.980 --> 28:16.200
it's complicated.

28:16.500 --> 28:18.890
What should I do? What should I do?

28:18.890 --> 28:19.860
How about this?

28:19.860 --> 28:20.930
I need to go out now.

28:20.930 --> 28:23.370
I'll give you an answer tomorrow morning.

28:23.620 --> 28:25.480
It's so late. Where are you going?

28:27.010 --> 28:28.290
Well...

28:39.170 --> 28:40.990
Wan'er, the water is ready.

28:41.010 --> 28:42.680
Go and wash up.

28:45.170 --> 28:46.890
What are you looking at?

28:49.050 --> 28:50.560
Nothing.

28:57.500 --> 28:58.620
It's cold at night.

28:58.620 --> 29:00.680
I'll close the window.

29:01.460 --> 29:03.150
Why close it?

29:03.170 --> 29:04.620
Today, didn't the doctor ask you

29:04.620 --> 29:07.010
to open the window more often for good ventilation?

29:08.010 --> 29:09.170
Just go and wash up.

29:09.170 --> 29:10.910
The water will be cold after a while.

29:10.930 --> 29:12.130
Just go!

29:12.130 --> 29:14.080
I'll make the bed for you.

29:40.100 --> 29:41.080
You're back.

29:41.100 --> 29:42.290
I've left you some food.

29:42.290 --> 29:43.840
I'll heat it up.

29:49.410 --> 29:50.500
No need to bother.

29:50.500 --> 29:52.230
I'm not that hungry.

29:52.250 --> 29:53.930
It's fine.

29:54.460 --> 29:56.480
Why did he go to bed so early today?

29:56.580 --> 29:58.720
Another day of hard play.

30:02.530 --> 30:03.960
Later,

30:03.980 --> 30:05.870
I'll ask Fan Xian to find him a teacher.

30:05.890 --> 30:07.650
He should be studying now.

30:07.650 --> 30:09.360
That's terrific!

30:09.380 --> 30:11.980
He's becoming wild

30:11.980 --> 30:14.290
after running about in the city all day long.

30:16.130 --> 30:17.560
He just told me that

30:17.580 --> 30:18.700
today he got to know

30:18.700 --> 30:19.700
a new friend

30:19.700 --> 30:20.860
living in a box

30:20.860 --> 30:23.080
and locked by chains.

30:23.220 --> 30:25.960
He's just a kid after all.

31:12.460 --> 31:14.480
Would you like a drumstick?

31:18.460 --> 31:20.290
Why are you here?

31:20.380 --> 31:21.410
If I say I'm here to deliver the night snack,

31:21.410 --> 31:22.930
will you believe me?

31:25.930 --> 31:28.030
You're a doctor in the day,

31:28.050 --> 31:29.250
but a pervert at night!

31:29.250 --> 31:29.740
That's not true! That's not true!

31:29.740 --> 31:31.010
You misunderstood me! You!

31:32.340 --> 31:34.530
I'm gonna kill you! Pervert!

31:36.250 --> 31:37.100
You hit me so hard!

31:37.100 --> 31:38.650
Can you be gentle?

31:42.500 --> 31:44.010
Dapiguan Palm!

31:49.930 --> 31:52.050
If you don't stop, I'll fight back!

32:01.010 --> 32:02.380
Stop! I'm not a pervert!

32:02.380 --> 32:04.080
You can ask Wan'er if you don't believe me.

32:09.250 --> 32:11.080
You are good!

32:14.340 --> 32:15.720
You're so violent!

32:58.340 --> 33:00.600
Wait for me here.

33:01.050 --> 33:02.410
Yes.

33:18.580 --> 33:20.320
She started it!

33:23.820 --> 33:25.320
I brought it for you.

33:28.130 --> 33:29.510
Does it hurt?

33:29.530 --> 33:31.440
I hardly hit her!

33:33.380 --> 33:34.840
Are you

33:35.700 --> 33:37.890
having a date?

33:40.580 --> 33:42.440
A princess and a doctor

33:42.460 --> 33:44.560
who are not afraid of worldly prejudice

33:44.580 --> 33:46.100
get together despite the difference of their statuses.

33:46.100 --> 33:46.770
It's just like

33:46.770 --> 33:48.050
the stories.

33:48.050 --> 33:49.100
What kind of stories

33:49.100 --> 33:50.480
do you usually read?

33:50.500 --> 33:52.250
You're good at martial arts.

33:52.700 --> 33:53.740
The palm technique

33:53.740 --> 33:54.700
you used

33:54.700 --> 33:55.750
right here

33:55.770 --> 33:56.650
is really smart!

33:56.650 --> 33:57.700
Which one?

33:57.700 --> 33:59.220
This one! This one!

33:59.220 --> 33:59.930
You flatter me.

33:59.930 --> 34:02.050
Your palm techniques are actually marvelous.

34:02.100 --> 34:04.220
What I used is called Dapiguan Palm!

34:04.220 --> 34:05.680
Fine. Fine.

34:05.770 --> 34:07.860
I lost to you because I'm lame.

34:07.860 --> 34:08.860
It doesn't mean the martial arts

34:08.860 --> 34:09.290
handed down by my family are lame.

34:09.290 --> 34:09.820
Sure. Sure.

34:09.820 --> 34:10.580
If you didn't step on that,

34:10.580 --> 34:11.930
I would never defeat you.

34:12.940 --> 34:14.410
That's not the case.

34:20.450 --> 34:21.580
I've thought about it.

34:21.580 --> 34:22.800
You led me here

34:22.820 --> 34:24.100
deliberately

34:24.100 --> 34:25.840
just now.

34:28.340 --> 34:29.950
I won't deny my loss.

34:29.970 --> 34:31.760
No need to comfort me.

34:32.180 --> 34:33.510
You've got another move.

34:33.530 --> 34:34.920
What's this called?

34:34.940 --> 34:36.080
Like this!

34:36.730 --> 34:37.920
Well.

34:37.940 --> 34:39.990
I haven't named it yet.

34:40.010 --> 34:42.490
It's just a small trick! See?

34:43.860 --> 34:44.660
Awesome! Awesome!

34:44.660 --> 34:45.340
Also! Also!

34:45.340 --> 34:46.010
You've got another move.

34:46.010 --> 34:47.050
Right, Wan'er!

34:47.050 --> 34:47.970
You didn't see it.

34:47.970 --> 34:49.690
He's got a really awesome move!

34:49.690 --> 34:51.320
Can you repeat...

34:52.660 --> 34:54.520
Sorry.

34:54.730 --> 34:56.560
I'm just too obsessed.

34:56.820 --> 34:58.530
You two should talk in private.

34:58.530 --> 34:59.620
I'll see myself out.

34:59.620 --> 35:01.240
I won't let anyone get close!

35:01.970 --> 35:03.210
Just talk.

35:13.860 --> 35:15.650
I finally find you.

35:16.860 --> 35:18.510
What for?

35:18.530 --> 35:20.080
I don't know.

35:20.250 --> 35:22.130
I just want to see you.

35:22.490 --> 35:23.290
Really?

35:23.290 --> 35:24.190
Really!

35:24.210 --> 35:24.970
Since we met last time

35:24.970 --> 35:26.560
in the Qing Temple,

35:26.580 --> 35:27.730
The happiest thing I feel

35:27.730 --> 35:29.210
is when I dream every day.

35:29.290 --> 35:30.180
Because I can see you

35:30.180 --> 35:31.890
in my dreams.

35:32.730 --> 35:33.660
I was scared

35:33.660 --> 35:35.450
every time I woke up.

35:35.970 --> 35:36.900
I was scared that

35:36.900 --> 35:38.520
we could only meet each other once.

35:38.860 --> 35:39.450
I was afraid that

35:39.450 --> 35:41.040
I could never see you again.

35:42.100 --> 35:43.730
Now it's all right!

35:44.100 --> 35:45.840
I've found you!

35:47.100 --> 35:49.690
I feel so relived after finding you.

36:03.010 --> 36:05.230
You're really a good talker.

36:05.250 --> 36:06.340
It must be a skill cultivated

36:06.340 --> 36:07.380
through dealing with women all the time.

36:07.380 --> 36:07.970
Is there any misunderstanding

36:07.970 --> 36:08.860
between us?

36:08.860 --> 36:10.890
I don't think so.

36:11.340 --> 36:13.470
You said you were the servant of Guo Baokun.

36:13.490 --> 36:15.430
I've sent Ling'er to ask him.

36:15.450 --> 36:16.250
Guo Baokun has stopped using

36:16.250 --> 36:17.380
a servant for a long time.

36:17.380 --> 36:18.450
I see.

36:18.450 --> 36:19.530
You went to Guo Baokun to...

36:19.530 --> 36:20.430
Don't move!

36:20.450 --> 36:22.320
...inquire about me?

36:22.490 --> 36:24.840
How rude and presumptuous of you

36:24.940 --> 36:27.280
to break into my boudoir at night!

36:35.690 --> 36:37.750
I've given you a hit in the day.

36:37.770 --> 36:38.490
Don't move!

36:38.490 --> 36:39.660
If you really don't want to see me,

36:39.660 --> 36:40.490
you'll take out the dagger

36:40.490 --> 36:42.000
when the other girl was here.

36:46.820 --> 36:48.490
This is an imperial residence.

36:48.490 --> 36:49.840
If you really get caught,

36:49.860 --> 36:51.690
you'll be sentenced to death.

36:52.530 --> 36:54.690
So you worry...

36:54.730 --> 36:56.160
You...

36:56.180 --> 36:57.670
I've known you after all,

36:57.690 --> 37:00.280
so I don't want to see you die.

37:00.450 --> 37:01.360
But

37:01.380 --> 37:02.380
I don't want to hear

37:02.380 --> 37:03.930
your sweet talks, either.

37:03.970 --> 37:05.560
You really think

37:06.100 --> 37:07.210
I am

37:07.210 --> 37:09.040
frivolous?

37:20.900 --> 37:22.370
Just leave.

37:23.730 --> 37:25.520
Listen.

37:33.290 --> 37:35.760
The window needs to be opened for good ventilation.

37:36.250 --> 37:37.250
What are you doing?

37:37.250 --> 37:39.050
But it's cold at night.

37:39.050 --> 37:40.840
-You'd better close it. -You...

37:43.660 --> 37:46.040
I ask you to leave. Don't you understand?

37:47.690 --> 37:49.560
Put it down! Put it down!

37:49.580 --> 37:50.560
Leave!

37:50.580 --> 37:51.840
Well...

37:51.860 --> 37:53.600
Just leave!

37:53.900 --> 37:55.100
Calm down!

37:55.100 --> 37:56.560
I'll leaving now!

38:10.580 --> 38:12.080
I agree to leave,

38:12.140 --> 38:14.600
not because I admit being dissolute.

38:15.770 --> 38:17.760
I'm afraid that you might hurt yourself.

38:19.380 --> 38:20.180
But every word

38:20.180 --> 38:21.710
I just said

38:21.730 --> 38:23.600
is from the bottom of my heart.

38:24.530 --> 38:26.490
I never mean to show disrespect.

38:32.140 --> 38:33.320
Wait!

38:36.820 --> 38:38.600
Who on earth are you?

38:40.250 --> 38:42.130
What's your name?

38:42.620 --> 38:44.040
I'm Fan Xian.

38:44.140 --> 38:46.230
Who do you think I am?

38:46.250 --> 38:47.730
How dare you humiliate me like this?

38:47.730 --> 38:49.580
I'm really Fan Xian!

38:49.580 --> 38:51.950
You know I'm engaged to him,

38:51.970 --> 38:53.050
so you said his name on purpose

38:53.050 --> 38:53.940
to tease me.

38:53.940 --> 38:55.140
It's not true.

38:55.140 --> 38:56.660
I'm Fan Xian.

38:56.660 --> 38:57.900
Fan Xian is me.

38:57.900 --> 38:58.620
I've been called Fan Xian

38:58.620 --> 38:59.490
for so many years.

38:59.490 --> 39:01.690
I'm Fan Xian for real!

39:02.970 --> 39:04.380
Vulgar as he is,

39:04.380 --> 39:06.270
I've already seen him.

39:06.290 --> 39:07.210
Actually, you pointed him to me

39:07.210 --> 39:07.940
on the poetry gathering.

39:07.940 --> 39:09.450
I have my reasons.

39:09.450 --> 39:11.600
I'll explain to you later.

39:12.290 --> 39:14.210
How is Fan Xian a vulgar man?

39:14.580 --> 39:15.580
He beat people on the streets.

39:15.580 --> 39:16.900
He's arrogant and impolite.

39:16.900 --> 39:17.770
Everyone knows about that.

39:17.770 --> 39:18.530
If you want to know a man,

39:18.530 --> 39:19.340
you need to meet him in person.

39:19.340 --> 39:20.290
You can't believe the rumors.

39:20.290 --> 39:20.970
What about fooling around

39:20.970 --> 39:21.920
with the singing girl on the carriage?

39:21.940 --> 39:22.940
I've never done that.

39:22.940 --> 39:24.140
Then you can't be Fan Xian.

39:24.140 --> 39:25.100
You're misled by rumors.

39:25.100 --> 39:26.180
I've seen it with my own eyes.

39:26.180 --> 39:26.860
I remember.

39:26.860 --> 39:28.140
Fan Sizhe was on that carriage.

39:28.140 --> 39:29.210
I was not there.

39:29.210 --> 39:30.930
You've misunderstood me.

39:31.690 --> 39:33.190
Stop justifying yourself!

39:33.210 --> 39:34.210
Listen!

39:34.210 --> 39:36.190
If you continue to be disrespectful,

39:36.210 --> 39:38.380
I can really hurt myself.

39:38.380 --> 39:39.690
Ruoruo came with me in the day.

39:39.690 --> 39:40.730
If I'm not Fan Xian,

39:40.730 --> 39:41.580
how would Ruoruo

39:41.580 --> 39:42.660
take a strange man

39:42.660 --> 39:44.800
to see her future sister-in-law?

39:46.820 --> 39:48.030
You've lived in the capital city for a long time.

39:48.050 --> 39:49.800
You should know what kind of a person Ruoruo is.

39:49.820 --> 39:51.800
She won't be so rude.

39:56.140 --> 39:56.620
You...

39:56.620 --> 39:59.210
How can you believe me?

40:35.250 --> 40:37.560
Write down that poem.

41:14.620 --> 41:16.710
Lady Ye, why are you standing here?

41:16.730 --> 41:18.130
I...

41:18.860 --> 41:21.000
I'm appreciating the beauty of the night.

41:22.860 --> 41:24.010
I did hear

41:24.010 --> 41:25.600
noise upstairs.

41:25.620 --> 41:27.930
I was practicing martial arts upstairs.

41:28.180 --> 41:29.620
I might have made some noise.

41:29.620 --> 41:30.990
Princess is sick and weak.

41:31.010 --> 41:31.820
Why would you practice martial arts

41:31.820 --> 41:33.600
in front of her?

41:35.050 --> 41:36.890
I'll check her up.

41:37.490 --> 41:38.940
Wan'er is asleep.

41:38.940 --> 41:39.970
Even if she is,

41:39.970 --> 41:41.420
I'm responsible for checking her up.

41:41.420 --> 41:43.370
Lady Ye, why do you stop me?

41:46.340 --> 41:47.760
You can't go inside!

42:05.180 --> 42:07.210
It's really you!

42:08.380 --> 42:10.230
Many people know this poem.

42:10.250 --> 42:11.710
Why are you sure it's me?

42:11.730 --> 42:14.450
Indeed! Many people know this poem,

42:16.820 --> 42:18.660
but only one person

42:18.660 --> 42:20.800
writes so ugly.

42:25.340 --> 42:27.130
Li Hongcheng gave it to me.

42:28.010 --> 42:29.690
Do you believe me now?

42:29.970 --> 42:30.820
How can you be...

42:30.820 --> 42:31.970
No need to go inside!

42:31.970 --> 42:33.420
Wan'er is really asleep!

42:33.420 --> 42:34.760
Get out of the way!

42:40.490 --> 42:42.410
You really don't have to check her up!

42:53.620 --> 42:55.730
I told you she's asleep!

43:26.120 --> 43:29.700
In the river of history,

43:29.720 --> 43:33.190
time goes round and round.

43:36.000 --> 43:39.340
Memories about the former and present lives

43:39.360 --> 43:43.430
join each other in an endless way.

43:45.320 --> 43:47.940
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:47.960 --> 43:50.200
one season follows another in a flash,

43:50.200 --> 43:52.700
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:52.720 --> 43:54.320
I just can't give up

43:54.320 --> 43:57.660
to be with you for my whole life.

43:57.680 --> 44:03.150
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:04.400 --> 44:06.950
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:07.240 --> 44:09.280
Year after year in the wandering,

44:09.280 --> 44:11.940
I count the remaining years.

44:11.960 --> 44:14.140
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:14.160 --> 44:16.150
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:16.440 --> 44:18.830
I never feel regretful.

44:18.880 --> 44:20.240
In such a chaotic world,

44:20.240 --> 44:23.220
I still miss you as ever.

44:23.240 --> 44:26.190
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:26.480 --> 44:28.540
With a gentle heart,

44:28.560 --> 44:31.220
I cherish our remaining years.

44:31.240 --> 44:32.760
Even though we have to go through

44:32.760 --> 44:35.270
all the hardships along the journey,

44:35.400 --> 44:42.590
you always stay by my side,

44:42.680 --> 44:45.350
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:45.640 --> 44:47.720
Year after year in the wandering,

44:47.720 --> 44:50.380
I count the remaining years.

44:50.400 --> 44:52.540
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:52.560 --> 44:54.790
even though we end up the destiny,

44:55.000 --> 44:57.180
I never feel regretful.

44:57.200 --> 44:58.600
In such a chaotic world,

44:58.600 --> 45:01.660
I still miss you as ever.

45:01.680 --> 45:04.790
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:04.880 --> 45:07.020
With a gentle heart,

45:07.040 --> 45:09.740
I cherish our remaining years.

45:09.760 --> 45:11.200
Even though we have to go through

45:11.200 --> 45:13.860
all the hardships along the journey,

45:13.880 --> 45:22.640
you always stay by my side...
